{"id": "8632a7c5-62c6-4f3e-ba39-5552eb21b7da", "slug": "nexus-ai-operations-platform-3", "title": "Nexus AI - Operations Platform", "description": "Operations Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus AI - Operations Platform\"\ndescription: \"Operations Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F59E0B\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#F97316\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#141418\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"22px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus AI - Operations Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 5; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: pricing, section, billing, cta, animated.\n## Overview\nOperations Platform Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nNexus AI Platform Solutions Pricing Docs Sign In Get Started UPDATE Sync infinite data sources Transform Your Operations Without the Overhead Teams waste countless hours linking systems, structuring data, and tracking e…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Transform Your Operations Without the Overhead; Amplify your output seamlessly.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F59E0B, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #F97316, background #0A0A0A, surface #141418, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus AI - Operations Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\"; }\n        .clip-text-reveal { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%); }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-zinc-100 overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-blue-200 scroll-smooth\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full -z-20 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-[#0a0a0a]/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-zinc-800/50\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-100 font-medium tracking-tight text-sm\">Nexus AI</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Docs</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sign In</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-950 bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors\">Get Started</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares Directive -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full -z-10 pointer-events-none flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full relative flex justify-between px-4 sm:px-8\">\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-zinc-800/30 relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-10 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-zinc-800/30 hidden md:block relative\">\n                 <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-zinc-800/30 hidden lg:block relative\">\n                 <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full w-px bg-zinc-800/30 relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-10 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-zinc-700\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center pt-32 pb-32 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm mb-8\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-950 bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full ring-2 ring-zinc-100/20 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-[#0f0f12]\">UPDATE</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">Sync infinite data sources</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Directive Target -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-6 leading-tight js-reveal-text\">\n                Transform Your Operations Without the Overhead\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 js-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                Teams waste countless hours linking systems, structuring data, and tracking events—leading to slower execution and process fatigue. We've built a better way.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Interactive Skeuomorphic Button -->\n            <div class=\"inline-block js-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                <button class=\"group relative min-w-[160px] h-[60px] px-6 rounded-[22px] flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-[#4A2B00] text-sm font-medium tracking-wide transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.95] shadow-[0_8px_24px_-6px_rgba(245,158,11,0.5),_inset_0_2px_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9),_inset_0_-4px_8px_rgba(180,83,9,0.7)] cursor-pointer\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, #FDE047 0%, #F59E0B 50%, #B45309 100%);\">\n                    <span>Discover Nexus AI</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:-translate-y-[2px] group-hover:translate-x-[2px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- UI Mockup & Overlay Area -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full mt-24 flex flex-col items-center js-mockup-section opacity-0 scale-[0.98]\">\n\n            <!-- Premium Border Gradient for Mockup -->\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/80 via-zinc-800/40 to-zinc-900/10 shadow-2xl relative flex\" style=\"height: 600px;\">\n                <!-- App UI Container -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0c] text-zinc-200 relative flex\">\n\n                    <!-- Sidebar -->\n                    <div class=\"w-16 border-r border-zinc-800/80 bg-[#0f0f12] flex flex-col items-center py-4 z-10 shrink-0\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-8 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 text-zinc-500 w-full items-center\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-2-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-blue-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:inbox-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-px bg-zinc-800 my-2\"></div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Main App Area with Alpha Mask -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[#0a0a0c] overflow-hidden relative\" style=\"-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);\">\n                        <!-- App Header -->\n                        <div class=\"h-14 border-b border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between px-6 bg-[#0f0f12]/80 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400\">Welcome back to Nexus AI</div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 cursor-pointer\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- App Content Split -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\">\n                            <!-- Left Pane (List) -->\n                            <div class=\"w-[350px] border-r border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col bg-[#0d0d10]\">\n                                <!-- Tabs -->\n                                <div class=\"flex gap-6 px-6 pt-4 border-b border-zinc-800/80\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-100 border-b-2 border-zinc-100 pb-2\">Pending Review</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 pb-2 hover:text-zinc-300 cursor-pointer\">Automated</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Search & Filter -->\n                                <div class=\"p-4 flex gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded-md bg-[#141418] focus-within:border-zinc-600 transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search...\" class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none text-[10px] w-full text-zinc-200 placeholder:text-zinc-500\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded-md bg-[#141418] flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-zinc-400 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:filter-linear\" width=\"12\"></iconify-icon> Filter\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- List -->\n                                <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 pb-4 space-y-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-zinc-500 mb-2 mt-2 px-2 tracking-wide uppercase\">Requires Action</div>\n                                    <!-- List Item 1 (Active) -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-700/50 cursor-pointer\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm border border-zinc-600 bg-zinc-900\"></div>\n                                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531427186611-ecfd6d936c79?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"JH\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(249,115,22,0.2)]\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-100\">James Holden</div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400\">j.holden@roci.space</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase\">New Lead</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <!-- List Item 2 -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-zinc-800/20 border border-transparent cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/50\"></div>\n                                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"NN\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300\">Naomi Nagata</div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500\">naomi@tycho.net</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase\">Follow Up</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                     <!-- List Item 3 -->\n                                     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-zinc-800/20 border border-transparent cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/50\"></div>\n                                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599566150163-29194dcaad36?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"AB\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300\">Amos Burton</div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500\">amos@baltimore.io</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase\">Qualified</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                     <!-- List Item 4 -->\n                                     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-zinc-800/20 border border-transparent cursor-pointer transition-colors\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/50\"></div>\n                                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"CA\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                            <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300\">C. Avasarala</div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500\">chrisjen@un.gov</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[8px] font-medium text-zinc-500 uppercase\">New Lead</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Right Pane (Detail) -->\n                            <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#0a0a0c] p-8 flex flex-col gap-8\">\n                                <!-- Detail Header -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-zinc-800/80 pb-6\">\n                                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531427186611-ecfd6d936c79?w=128&h=128&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"James Holden\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(249,115,22,0.15)]\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                            James Holden <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.6)]\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5\">Chief Technology Officer at Tycho</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Info Grid -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Company Status</div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-200\">Enterprise</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Industry</div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-200\">Space Logistics</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Location</div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-200\">Ceres Station</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Action Card -->\n                                <div class=\"border border-zinc-800/80 rounded-xl bg-[#0f0f12] p-5 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <!-- Subtle inner glow -->\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-zinc-700/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-6\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-100\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-amber-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            Suggested Outreach\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Edit Template</div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"mb-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Campaign Target</div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-200 font-medium\">Q4 Supply Chain Optimization</span>\n                                            <span class=\"text-[8px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-medium border border-amber-500/10\">High Priority</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n                                        <div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Account Executive</div>\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"David B\" class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover\">\n                                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300\">David B.</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div>\n                                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Technical Lead</div>\n                                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?w=64&h=64&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Sarah M\" class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full object-cover\">\n                                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300\">Sarah M.</span>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div>\n                                         <div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mb-2\">Schedule</div>\n                                         <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-300\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-date-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            Nov 02, 2023 — Nov 16, 2023\n                                         </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Heavy Fade Overlay to blend Mockup into background -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[60%] bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0a] via-[#0a0a0a]/95 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-20 flex flex-col justify-end items-start px-4 sm:px-8 pb-12\">\n\n                <!-- Secondary Overlay Content -->\n                <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto translate-y-8\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-xl js-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4 leading-tight\">\n                            Amplify your output seamlessly\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-lg\">\n                            Our platform executes thousands of background actions daily, eliminating mundane workflows to maximize efficiency and preserve critical resources.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-full bg-zinc-800 shrink-0 js-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-4 pointer-events-auto\">\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-wide hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors border border-zinc-800\">\n                            Try Nexus AI\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Stats Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mt-8 pt-12 relative js-fade-up opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n            <!-- Border Gradients Directive: Glowing top divider -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-500/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1/2 h-[1px] bg-blue-400 blur-sm opacity-30\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-y-12 gap-x-0 relative z-10\">\n                <!-- Stat 1 -->\n                <div class=\"px-6 lg:border-r border-zinc-800/50 flex flex-col items-start group\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3 uppercase\">Output</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform origin-left\">350%</div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed pr-4\">Teams report massive gains in deployment speed and pipeline management within weeks.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 2 -->\n                <div class=\"px-6 lg:border-r border-zinc-800/50 flex flex-col items-start group\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3 uppercase\">Capital Saved</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform origin-left\">$3.8M</div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed pr-4\">Cost reductions achieved by consolidating legacy toolchains and minimizing human error margins.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 3 -->\n                <div class=\"px-6 lg:border-r border-zinc-800/50 flex flex-col items-start group\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3 uppercase\">Hours Saved</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform origin-left\">92,000</div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed pr-4\">Time formerly drained by tedious tracking is immediately reclaimed for mission-critical planning.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 4 -->\n                <div class=\"px-6 flex flex-col items-start group\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3 uppercase\">Deployment</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform origin-left\">&lt; 2 MO</div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed pr-4\">Our onboarding process is optimized to help organizations see measurable impact almost instantly.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background Animation (Three.js Atmospheric Tech Backdrop) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Dense near-black base background\n            scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x050505);\n            // Deep fog for alpha falloff and distance fade\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x050505, 0.04);\n\n            // Low-angle perspective camera\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.set(0, 1.5, 5);\n\n            // 1. Receding Ghosted Plane Grid\n            const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(100, 50, 0xffffff, 0xffffff);\n            gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n            gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.06;\n            scene.add(gridHelper);\n\n            // 2. Sparse Floating Particles\n            const particleCount = 300;\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const positions = new Float32Array(particleCount * 3);\n            const phases = new Float32Array(particleCount);\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                positions[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40;     // x\n                positions[i * 3 + 1] = Math.random() * 10;         // y\n                positions[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40; // z\n                phases[i] = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n            geometry.setAttribute('phase', new THREE.BufferAttribute(phases, 1));\n\n            // Custom shader for translucent additive glow and soft bobbing\n            const particleMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 },\n                    uColor: { value: new THREE.Color(0xffffff) }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    uniform float uTime;\n                    attribute float phase;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n                    void main() {\n                        vec3 pos = position;\n                        // Soft sinusoidal vertical bobbing\n                        pos.y += sin(uTime * 0.5 + phase) * 0.3;\n                        vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\n                        // Distance size attenuation\n                        gl_PointSize = (10.0 / -mvPosition.z);\n                        vAlpha = 1.0;\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform vec3 uColor;\n                    varying float vAlpha;\n                    void main() {\n                        // Circular shape mask\n                        float d = distance(gl_PointCoord, vec2(0.5));\n                        if (d > 0.5) discard;\n                        // Soft luminous bloom falloff\n                        float alpha = smoothstep(0.5, 0.1, d) * 0.3 * vAlpha;\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(uColor, alpha);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(geometry, particleMaterial);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            // 3. Smooth Parallax Camera Input Tracking\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n                mouseY = -(e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 + 1;\n            });\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Infinite forward drift (grid cell size is 2 units)\n                gridHelper.position.z = (time * 1.5) % 2;\n\n                // Particle update and slow environmental rotation\n                particleMaterial.uniforms.uTime.value = time;\n                particles.rotation.y = time * 0.015;\n\n                // Camera smoothly lags behind cursor for depth effect\n                const targetX = mouseX * 1.5;\n                const targetY = 1.5 + mouseY * 0.5;\n                camera.position.x += (targetX - camera.position.x) * 0.03;\n                camera.position.y += (targetY - camera.position.y) * 0.03;\n                camera.lookAt(0, 1.5, -10);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n\n            animate();\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations (Masked Reveal & ScrollTriggers) ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            const revealTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.js-reveal-text');\n\n            revealTexts.forEach(textEl => {\n                const words = textEl.innerText.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n                textEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(100%)';\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    textEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n                    if (i < words.length - 1) {\n                        textEl.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n                    }\n                });\n\n                const inners = textEl.querySelectorAll('span > span');\n                gsap.to(inners, {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: textEl,\n                        start: 'top 85%',\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // 2. Simple Fade Ups\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.js-fade-up').forEach(el => {\n                gsap.to(el, {\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    y: 0,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: 'top 90%',\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // 3. Mockup Scale In\n            gsap.to('.js-mockup-section', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: 'expo.out',\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.js-mockup-section',\n                    start: 'top 70%',\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            setTimeout(initGSAP, 100);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-ai-operations-platform-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-ai-operations-platform-3.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-ai-operations-platform-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 56, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T20:09:06.944682+00:00"}